美，大师杰作。冰雪秘境，神白雪皑皑，画面干净，色彩丰富，体现出阳光初绽照射到冰雪房屋或者树木上的画面。画面中心是一排精致的北方冰雪树木，中间一个树屋树屋呈圆形，外墙是清新的白色，木质地板纹理清晰。树屋顶部被一层翠绿的草皮覆盖，点缀着黄色的小花和一个橙色的南瓜，显得生机勃勃。屋内，几只圆滚滚、通体白色的可爱生物，或躺或趴，似乎在惬意地休息。树屋的窗户透出温暖的光，窗台上摆放着绿植盆栽。树屋周围，茂密的绿色树木层层叠叠，树叶以简洁明快的线条勾勒。下方的水面上漂浮着大大的荷叶，水面上还散落着一些黄色的小花，增添了画面的生动感。整体画面运用明亮鲜艳的白色为主色调，屋内营造出一种奇幻、可爱且温馨的森林童话氛围，仿佛带领观众进入一个充满惊喜的童话世界。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 43, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 86, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [423.828125, 177.109375], "pos": [-221.41526794433594, 522.2845458984375], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [6], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["blurry ugly bad"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 44, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 87, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [425.2734375, 180.5989532470703], "pos": [-223.7804412841797, 557.2000732421875], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [87], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [395.4385986328125, 139.56137